[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3961.19, "timestamp": "01:06:01", "text": "そこを調べてみるべきかもしれない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3963.91, "timestamp": "01:06:03", "text": "反対側を見てください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3965.67, "timestamp": "01:06:05", "text": "彼女は待っていない。彼女は待っていない。彼女はただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.309, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "見ています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.95, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "うん。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3968.87, "timestamp": "01:06:08", "text": "H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3970.39, "timestamp": "01:06:10", "text": "何ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3971.91, "timestamp": "01:06:11", "text": "何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3975.109, "timestamp": "01:06:15", "text": "これですか？の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3975.67, "timestamp": "01:06:15", "text": "ミティ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3979.109, "timestamp": "01:06:19", "text": "何？何？それは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3980.95, "timestamp": "01:06:20", "text": "これは肉に違いない、と彼らは話していた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3981.67, "timestamp": "01:06:21", "text": "について。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3983.67, "timestamp": "01:06:23", "text": "あれが見えますか？この廊下全体が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3986.15, "timestamp": "01:06:26", "text": "脈動する塊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3987.51, "timestamp": "01:06:27", "text": "肉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.67, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "まあ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3993.43, "timestamp": "01:06:33", "text": "私はそれを踏まない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3995.829, "timestamp": "01:06:35", "text": "ちょっと投げてもいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3998.23, "timestamp": "01:06:38", "text": "そこにダンジョンフードがあるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3999.589, "timestamp": "01:06:39", "text": "ご自由にどうぞ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4000.95, "timestamp": "01:06:40", "text": "わかった。私はただ投げるだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4003.589, "timestamp": "01:06:43", "text": "ダンジョンの食べ物を入れる。よし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4005.67, "timestamp": "01:06:45", "text": "ダンジョンフードを入れる。そのうちの1つを投げ入れる。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4008.11, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "brb in 2 min"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4009.67, "timestamp": "01:06:49", "text": "中に入って、それが乗ったとき"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4011.029, "timestamp": "01:06:51", "text": "肉は、少し泡立っているような感じで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4012.789, "timestamp": "01:06:52", "text": "でもそれは普通のことだよ、そういう意味で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4014.71, "timestamp": "01:06:54", "text": "何かが消化されるのを見るような、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4017.19, "timestamp": "01:06:57", "text": "でも、まるで押し下げられたみたい"}]